    "udt_struct_v0": {
      "doc": "One step in a custodial route. `arg_refs` maps `arg_idx \\xe2\\x86\\x92 prior step\\nindex` for runtime substitution from `returns`. The substituted value is\\ncoerced u128\\xe2\\x86\\x94i128 to match the type of the placeholder the route author\\nput at `args[arg_idx]`. `output_token` is required when `fee_position`\\nreferences this step.\\n\\nNote: when `fee_position` targets step `i`, the stored return of step `i`\\nis replaced by the router's post-fee balance of `output_token` (as a\\nnumber, coerced to the original return's numeric type). Later `arg_refs`\\nto step `i` therefore resolve to the post-fee balance \\xe2\\x80\\x94 steps whose\\nreturn is referenced after a fee stop must return a numeric value.",
      "lib": "",
      "name": "RouteStep",
      "fields": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "arg_refs",
